om browse.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered Quinn Tester / quinn.tester@example.com / secret123 / Portland, OR → redirected to home and header shows authenticated state with \\\"Sell\\\" and \\\"Quinn Tester\\\" user menu.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined Upcycled-only + Furniture + New + price $20-$250 → 1 result satisfying all criteria; distance ≤12 mi correctly excluded the 15-mi listing. Sorts: Price Low→High produced 35,45,55,65,95,125,175,180,285,320; Distance reordered ascending (15-mi item last); Newest First placed the just-created listing first. Minor UI defect: the max-price slider thumb is not rendered (max is only adjustable by clicking the track), though the $ range label and filtering work.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"DENIM\\\"→1 (title match), \\\"AUSTIN\\\"→3 items all located Austin, TX (location match), \\\"levi\\\"→Vintage Denim Jacket (description match), \\\"MACRAME\\\"→1; clearing the query restored all 10 listings.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Marcus added Emma's Macrame ($45) and Armchair ($285); clicking Add to Cart twice on the macrame kept it once (badge stayed 1). /cart shows \\\"2 items\\\", each with photo, title link, location Brooklyn, NY and price, Total $330.00 (45+285).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Marcus on Emma's /product/prod-1: \\\"Message Seller\\\" dialog \\\"Send a message to Emma Green\\\"; Send button disabled while empty; after typing a message and sending, dialog closed with toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category chosen on /categories page is not applied to browse results\", \"actual\": \"Clicking \\\"Furniture\\\" (3 items) on /categories navigated to /?category=furniture, but the browse page showed all 10 listings, count \\\"10 items available\\\", and no category checkbox was checked (even after waiting). The home page \\\"Shop by Category\\\" tiles do work (Clothing → 1 item, count \\\"1 items available\\\").\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Sellers have no way to view received purchase requests\", \"actual\": \"Marcus sent a product-page message (\\\"QA-REQUEST-42...\\\") and a cart-wide \\\"Send Purchase Request\\\" for Emma's items (toasts: \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\" / \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" with the cart emptied immediately). Signing in as Emma, no requested item or buyer message is visible anywhere: My Listings shows only listing cards with View/Mark Sold/Delete, her own product pages show only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\", the user-menu \\\"My Profile\\\" link renders the 404 page, and /requests is also 404. The cart request is reported as sent with no verifiable per-item record.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with nobody-unregistered@example.com showed \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\", stayed on /login, header still showed Log in/Sign up.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registering \\\"EMMA@Example.com\\\" (case variant of existing emma@example.com) showed toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\"; stayed on /register, no session created, existing account intact.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password is not validated; any password authenticates a registered account\", \"actual\": \"Signed in as emma@example.com using the arbitrary password \\\"totally-wrong-xyz\\\": redirected to / and header changed to show \\\"Sell\\\" (authenticated). Login page even states \\\"(any password works)\\\".\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Owner (Emma) sees View/Mark Sold/Mark Available/Delete in My Listings and \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" on her own product page. Signed in as Marcus viewing Emma's listing /product/prod-5, only \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\" buttons exist — no edit/sold/delete controls; /my-listings shows only Marcus's own items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty submit blocked by required-field validation (native messages on title/description/price); with all text fields filled but no photo → toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\"; with photo+text but no category/condition → toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\". No listing created in any case (stayed on /create-listing).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price -5 blocked: input has min=0, validity invalid \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\", stayed on /create-listing, no listing created. Non-numeric \\\"abc\\\" coerced to empty and blocked by required validation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Protected seller routes render a blank page instead of a sign-in prompt or redirect\", \"actual\": \"Good: unauthenticated \\\"Add to Cart\\\" redirects to /login with toast \\\"Please log in to add items to your cart\\\"; \\\"Message Seller\\\" dialog shows \\\"Log in to message\\\"; cart trigger is hidden. But visiting /create-listing or /my-listings while signed out renders a completely empty page (document.body.innerText === \\\"\\\") with no sign-in prompt and no redirect.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Duplicate-email submit